MBT55 forms:
- Biofilms  
- Microbial mats  
- Surface colonies  

This physically prevents pathogen colonization.

---

## 3.4 Microbial Succession Control
MBT55 guides ecological succession toward:
- Fermentation  
- Humification  
- Regeneration  

Instead of:
- Putrefaction  
- Spoilage  
- Pathogen bloom  

