PBPE‑UID Issuance
↓
PBPE Registry (Blockchain)
↓
PBPE Financial Products
↓
Investors Allocate Capital
↓
40/40/20 Distribution
```

# 5. PBPE Financial Products

Standardized under **PBPE‑FIN‑001**:

- PBPE Carbon Income Bonds
    
