- Settlement records
    
- Audit trails
    

# 8. Vision

PBPE Marketplace establishes **planetary value as a global asset class**, creating a regenerative economic system where:

- Soil
    
- Water
    
- Microbiome
    
- Health
    
- Waste-to-resource
    

are primary sources of economic value.

