# Pathway Engine (MBT55 / Microbiome–Metabolite)

## Overview

The **Pathway Engine** maps:

- Disease ↔ Metabolic State ↔ MBT55 ↔ Intervention  
- Microbiome taxa ↔ Metabolites ↔ MBT55 pathways (MBT55 Pathways)

It is the core of **microbiome–metabolite–disease** reasoning.

