- PBPE: Planetary Balanced Public Economy
- A system to balance:
  - Ecological regeneration
  - Social equity and health
  - Economic stability and innovation
- PBPE Platform: Marketplace, Value Engine, Currency Model, Sovereign Bond Engine.

