# Slide 4 – PBPE Sovereign Bond Overview
- A sovereign debt instrument embedded in PBPE metrics.
- Key features:
  - Multi-dimensional value scoring (PBPE Value Engine)
  - Conditional coupon and maturity structures
  - Transparent public reporting via PBPE Marketplace.

---

