FX_s = \gamma_1 P_s + \gamma_2 H + \gamma_3 SOC + \gamma_4 GHG
\]



with:



\[
\sum_{i=1}^{4} \gamma_i = 1
\]



\section*{7. PBPE Exchange Rate Model}

Let $E_{PBPE/USD}$ be the PBPE/USD exchange rate.

