```
AgriImpactIntent
ClimateImpactIntent
HealthImpactIntent
        ↓
PBPE Impact Engine
        ↓
PBPE Financial Product Valuation
```

### Impact Engine の役割
- Intent の PBPE 値を金融商品に変換  
