# Ⅲ．メインループ

```pseudo
FUNCTION AgriWare_MainLoop():

    WHILE system_active:

        data ← ReadSensors()

        state ← EstimateMetabolicState(data)

        stability ← EvaluateHypercycle(state)

        control_actions ← DecideControls(state, stability)

        ExecuteControls(control_actions)

        WAIT Δt
```

