## 補足：なぜ「分解→発酵→代謝」が要なのか

- **発酵で得られるSCFA（特に酪酸）**は、**上皮の主燃料・抗炎症メディエーター**で、EED/下痢後の**粘膜回復**の理論的主柱。([Frontiers](https://www.frontiersin.org/journals/microbiology/articles/10.3389/fmicb.2022.1103836/full?utm_source=chatgpt.com "Butyrate producers, “The Sentinel of Gut”: Their intestinal ..."))
    
- **BSHを含む胆汁酸変換**は、**脂質吸収や病原性制御**を含む広い腸内ネットワークのハブ。([PMC](https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC11860951/?utm_source=chatgpt.com "New insights into microbial bile salt hydrolases"), [Nature](https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-023-06990-w?utm_source=chatgpt.com "Bile salt hydrolase catalyses formation of amine- ..."))
    
- **特定ポリフェノールの「腸内での活性化」**（UA, VALs, Compound K, エクオールなど）は、**原料の“潜在力”を引き出す**鍵。([サイエンスダイレクト](https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S2095177921001179?utm_source=chatgpt.com "Interactions between gut microbiota and berberine, a ..."), [PMC](https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC9031344/?utm_source=chatgpt.com "Insights into Recent Studies on Biotransformation and ..."), [Lippincott Journals](https://journals.lww.com/pidj/fulltext/2020/11000/a_multicenter%2C_randomized%2C_double_blind%2C.4.aspx?utm_source=chatgpt.com "A Multicenter, Randomized, Double-blind, Placebo-controlled Trial of"))
    
- **S. boulardii**は急性下痢領域で**即効性ユースケース**が確立しており、**MBT55の長期腸内改造**と**短期症状緩和**のブリッジになる。([Lippincott Journals](https://journals.lww.com/pidj/fulltext/2020/11000/a_multicenter%2C_randomized%2C_double_blind%2C.4.aspx?utm_source=chatgpt.com "A Multicenter, Randomized, Double-blind, Placebo-controlled Trial of"), [PubMed](https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/26216624/?utm_source=chatgpt.com "Saccharomyces boulardii in the prevention of antibiotic- ..."))
    

