|🌍 Connection to Earth Systems|Achieves SOC accumulation, heavy metal inactivation, and reduction of CO₂ and CH₄, linking to global biogeochemistry.|

🔷 **8. Flywheel Model of MBT55-Driven Self-Accelerating Regenerative Systems**

**MBT55-centered loop connecting agriculture, social costs, and carbon economy:**

```
[1] Collection of food waste & crop residues  
        ↓ (Local resource conversion)  
