**Revenue & Carbon-Neutral Forecast:**  
By expanding early unit adoption, adding optional services, and utilizing the carbon credit market, a stable and sustainable business model with environmental benefits can be achieved.

**Economic Benefits by Raw Material:**  
Significant improvement in total economic effect by reducing costs and generating revenue through value-added products like compost and feed.

