Through regional collaboration, recycling integration, and digital tools, forests can become engines of regional revenue and sustainability.

The above evaluations and concepts should be validated with further detailed studies, pilot projects, and stakeholder collaboration, but overall, the MBT Sustainable Cycle System holds tremendous potential for both environmental and economic impact.

