# Ⅳ．代謝状態推定

```pseudo
FUNCTION EstimateMetabolicState(data):

    MgP_ratio ← data.Mg / data.P

    ATP_efficiency ← f_ATP(MgP_ratio, data.pH, data.Eh)

    Nitrogenase_activity ← f_Nitrogenase(
                              data.Mo,
                              data.Fe,
                              data.pH,
                              data.Eh)

    RETURN {
        MgP_ratio,
        ATP_efficiency,
        Nitrogenase_activity,
        MicrobialDensity = data.MicrobialDensity
    }
```

