PBPE places the regenerative power of plants at the center of the global economy, simultaneously addressing climate, food, health, and employment challenges. Designed by Kaz, PBPE transforms blockchain into an infrastructure for circulating **real, measurable social and environmental value**, establishing a next-generation planetary economic model.

